ne.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">i</span></span> don't th<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">i</span></span>\u200bnk so. Wh<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200bn/wh<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200br<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200b <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">i</span></span>\u200b\u200bs your proj<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200bct s<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200bt?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12161-browman","name":"Browman","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-04T13:50:42-08:00","id":1558642,"title":"","content":"Sorry for late reply. I had some work to do academically and couldnt return here soon. I read your work and found it amazingly good. Great job really. <br /> <br /> We are telling/writing stories of modified World of Darkness splats in Anatolia and near Balkans and MiddleEast regions, our games are mostly in held in Turkiye. Our project called Anadolu Hikaye Anlat\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 (en: Anatolian Storytellers) . I'm personally responsible of Werewolf the Apocalypse lore in our storyline but also Mage too. Our motto is &quot;telling local stories and telling stories from locals&quot;. We are gathering conspiracies, folklores and myths and adapting them into from Dark Ages to Modern Nights. Our project games mostly set on high populated cities of Turkiye such as Istanbul, Ankara, Izmir etc. We also written some short play-ready stories/chronicles for one-shots but our unpublished work is actually based on how Ankaran Sarch from VTMB travelled from Turkiye to USA. We are still preparing mechanics and writing-adapting lore for it. <br /> <br /> In short, our project based on Turkiye and nearities. Also working on an Ottoman setting for Victorian Age-line. Actually it can be set on anytime anyplace, we didnt really decide on such absolutes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i><b>Erol Mazhar &quot;\u200bCroc&quot; Aksoy</b></i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/505-croctheone","name":"CrocTheOne","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-04T14:40:53-08:00","id":1558643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CrocTheOne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1558297-rage-across-anatolia-an-unofficial-savage-age-document?p=1558642#post1558642\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sorry for late reply. I had some work to do academically and couldnt return here soon. I read your work and found it amazingly good. Great job really.<br /> <br /> We are telling/writing stories of modified World of Darkness splats in Anatolia and near Balkans and MiddleEast regions, our games are mostly in held in Turkiye. Our project called Anadolu Hikaye Anlat\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 (en: Anatolian Storytellers) . I'm personally responsible of Werewolf the Apocalypse lore in our storyline but also Mage too. Our motto is &quot;telling local stories and telling stories from locals&quot;. We are gathering conspiracies, folklores and myths and adapting them into from Dark Ages to Modern Nights. Our project games mostly set on high populated cities of Turkiye such as Istanbul, Ankara, Izmir etc. We also written some short play-ready stories/chronicles for one-shots but our unpublished work is actually based on how Ankaran Sarch from VTMB travelled from Turkiye to USA. We are still preparing mechanics and writing-adapting lore for it.<br /> <br /> In short, our project based on Turkiye and nearities. Also working on an Ottoman setting for Victorian Age-line. Actually it can be set on anytime anyplace, we didnt really decide on such absolutes.</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds v<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>ry cool, is th<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200br<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200b anywh<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200br<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e </span></span>i\u200b can r<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200bad mor<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200b of your guys work? Ottoman bas<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200bd stuff could b<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200b sup<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">e</span></span>\u200br cool for most gam<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\